Position Overview
 DB Global Technology is Deutsche Bank’s technology centre in Central and Eastern Europe. Since its set-up in 2013, Bucharest Technology Centre (BEX) has constantly proven its capacity to deliver global technology products and services, playing a dynamic role in the Bank’s technology transformation.
We have a robust, hands-on engineering culture dedicated to continuous learning, knowledge-sharing, technical skill development and networking. We are an essential part of the Bank’s technology platform and develop applications for many important business areas.
 Responsibilities:
Responsibility for testing activities on the alocated project;
Ability to define the test strategy, preparation of test concepts;
Participate in system integration and user acceptance testing;
Communicate with business, project managers, product owners, developers, deployment managers, IT application owners
Maintain QA-related project documentation;
Development and maintenance of the test automation framework;
Developing tests cases, test plans, test scripts, test data sets, or test procedures based on business requirements;
Reporting results of automated tests to development teams so that defects can be addressed before production release.
 Skills:
Bachelor or Master Degree in computer science or similar;
Solid understanding of Scrum, Kanban and/or Agile software development methodologies;
Experience in at least one programming language and software development best practices (Java/OOP preferred);
Experience with automated testing frameworks (Selenium + Java preferred);
Knowledge of BDD methodology, practical experience in BDD testing;
Strong experience with API Testing and tools (Postman, Soap UI);
Experience with load and performance testing (jMeter);
Strong experience with test planning, test documentation, defect tracking, reporting tools (ALM, Jira, TestRail or similar);
Knowledge of databases;
Understanding of CI/CD and DevOps practices and tooling (Jenkins, TeamCity, OpenShift, Docker and Kubernetes);
At least a basic understanding of retail banking and operations processes;
Proven ability to leverage AI tools to enhance productivity, optimise workflows to solve business problems, while applying critical judgment to ensure responsible and ethical use of data and AI outputs.
